      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MCVEIGH (1) has rushed through the grades, winning both of his starts this season off the top, matching his easy win here when ending his last season. He remains in the same grade for this, and an extra 1.5kg to carry may not be enough to stop him from repeating the dose. GEEGEES DOWNPOUR (3) made the most of a top ride, with a well-timed run to score fresh up from near last over 1200m and then rushed home too late for third by less than a length over 1100m 3 weeks ago. He carries 3kg less this time and can have the last say. VORTISTAR (4) was too strong in front fresh up, then weakened last time out when working too hard for the front off a wide draw in the hands of a 4kg apprentice. Senior hoop Luke Dempsey takes the reins, and from a superior gate, he can bounce straight back into the money. ZUNI (5) has hit the line strongly in her last 2 starts, steps up to 1200m for this, and with only 51kg to carry, she can run into the money this time. Keep safe. BRAVE JET (6) has claims.",
